  "title": "Training with NextDent Ortho Flex",
  "summary": "<span>Training with NextDent Ortho Flex</span> <span><span>Elizabeth Piet</span></span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-06-24T16:58:43-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, June 24, 2026 - 16:58\">Wed, 06/24/2026 - 16:58</time> </span> <div class=\"field field-node--field-thumbnail field-name-field-thumbnail field-type-image field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Thumbnail</div> <picture class=\"responsive-image-container\"> <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/general_small/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=M2j65r3O 640w, /sites/default/files/styles/general_medium/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=hwDFObKN 1024w, /sites/default/files/styles/general_large/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=nE-FGhnD 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\"> <img srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/general_small/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=M2j65r3O 640w, /sites/default/files/styles/general_medium/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=hwDFObKN 1024w, /sites/default/files/styles/general_large/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=nE-FGhnD 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/general_medium/public/2026-07/3d-systems-nextdent-ortho-flex-thumbnail.png.webp?itok=hwDFObKN\" alt=\"NextDent Ortho Flex\" width=\"940\" height=\"494\" loading=\"lazy\" > </picture> </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-page-type-term field-name-field-page-type-term field-type-entity-reference field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Event Type</div> Webinar </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-start-date field-name-field-start-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden\"> <time datetime=\"2025-06-04T15:00:00Z\">2025-06-04T15:00:00+0000</time> </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-end-date field-name-field-end-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden\"> <time datetime=\"2026-06-04T16:00:00Z\">2026-06-04T16:00:00+0000</time> </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-overview field-name-field-overview field-type-entity-reference-revisions field-label-hidden\"> <div data-component-type=\"content_wysiwyg_text\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--content-wysiwyg-text paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"field field-paragraph--field-text field-name-field-text field-type-text-long field-label-hidden\"> <p>NextDent Ortho Flex, is an advanced 3D printing material designed specifically for the production of dental splints and retainers. In this session, you’ll gain a comprehensive overview of this clear, biocompatible Class IIa resin, known for its optimal balance of strength, flexibility, and aesthetic transparency.&nbsp; The video walks through key workflows, printing considerations, and post-processing techniques, helping dental professionals and labs achieve consistent, high-quality results. Whether you are new to digital dentistry or looking to optimize your in-house production, this training provides practical insights to maximize performance, efficiency, and long-term stability with NextDent Ortho Flex.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-timezone field-name-field-timezone field-type-tzfield field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Timezone</div> America/Chicago </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-partner-event field-name-field-partner-event field-type-boolean field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Partner Event</div> Off </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-external-form field-name-field-external-form field-type-entity-reference-revisions field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Registration form</div> </div> <div class=\"field field-node--field-technology-term field-name-field-technology-term field-type-entity-reference field-label-above\"> <div class=\"field-label\">Technology</div> <a href=\"/taxonomy/term/1866\" hreflang=\"en\">NextDent</a> </div>",
